    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sooscheew iyeenya bea shaboogheeta",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata Nebukadinesa was sugoocheanda Babeli nea niyaat ghealooniga Yekoniya orjeeda Yehoyakimu, was sugoocheanda Yuda, niny sea fuga hees bea Yuda, ea gearnoodiga, ea fuga gadiyeata gidayda, nea ghang'eada Yerusalemu ea ghwahita Babeli, hean ghoahiimnaani NG'UTAMIIDA giirgweatsu: Ng'ula ghaadaayi sooscheewi iyeenya mida jeeda haghweega shaboogheeta nea gwanda madeeda gheeda sibata NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea sooscheanda madeeda ghwanyiit haghweega miyaasiin gawuurji gea haghweega madeeda, nea deaba iyeenya gaba haghweega munyas, ea munyas muuchi ea mwoamu eayaak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, “Gidaahi naaha, Yeremiya?” Hean geayeeshi, “Ghaadaayi haghweega shaboogheeta, haghweega miyaasiin ea gea munyas mwoamu eayaak.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwaan ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA heedeanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA fuga Israeli: Giduurji haghweesu miyaasiin bea shaboogheetean, hean eara fuga Yuda gaydanung' ghamiyaasiit was gea ghayi eanung' ghang'amwa hiji ak gaweay ghealooniga aba ng'eanyiida Galdayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gaydaahaaghwa saawa muuchi, ak gaydaaghuumu gabiigu ng'eanyiini. Ak gaydanung' gang'adu, nea maygudu danung' goobeedeayi, hean gaydang'aapta ak ea maydaloata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaydanyaksa guroorooda jea ghwanal gideaba aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA, ak gayghoah fugeasu ak eara aniini gaydoaw ASEETA nyaawa, aba gideaba gaygwayamsean geat aba gurooruunatka nyaawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Asi gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA: Giduurji shaboogheeta munyas mwoamu eayaak, nih ea gichea dasima Sedekiya gil was sugoocheanda Yuda, niny sea fugaaschi hees, ea easanga siipuusa ng'eanyiini, gea abiita ng'eanyiida Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaydanung' ghoah gisisit aba jeeda gheambalmoojiga sean bea ng'eanyiida, gayghoah fuga jea eemachiida nea geebara budeayi, nea geebara reari, nea geemooriida aba hiji nyooh dahoosa gaweay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydaahaak ng'uta, ea geejeeda, ea dawni, bwak ea goosha sean aba jeeda ng'eanyiida ghayi aadawji saawa ea ghweaniga nyaawa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
